From 1d5eb5b71747a71039e77db2ca0de82c449738ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:09:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 34/35] temp/libcamera: upgrade to 0.8.0 with the OnePlus 8 Pro
 patches

Rebase on the 0.8.0 package of pmaports main and port the contrast detection autofocus to the renamed softisp IPA. Adds the sensor helpers and tuning files for S5K3M5, IMX586, IMX689 and GC5035; the IMX471 helper is part of 0.8.0 now. The autofocus rescans only after a sharpness change of 25 % in four statistics frames in a row, so low light noise no longer makes the lens hunt.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
