-position, using the sharpness measure of the software ISP statistics. In
-continuous mode, scan again when the sharpness changes for a few
-statistics frames in a row. Support AfMode and AfTrigger and report
-AfState. Enabled by adding Af to the tuning file of a camera with a focus
-lens.
